OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,FOver a dozen residents were evacuated
OL,7,Ffrom a village on the outskirts of
OL,8,FCardiff after their homes flooded
OL,9,Ffollowing an "incident" at a nearby
OL,10,Fquarry.
OL,12,FCardiff Council confirmed the
OL,13,Fflooding, which happened on Thursday
OL,14,Fafternoon (July 30), affected 15 homes
OL,15,Fin Gwaelod-y-Garth and saw 13
OL,16,Fproperties evacuated.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/10
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
