FL,451,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,FLocals say the flooding happened
OL,7,Fminutes after a "blast" at a nearby
OL,8,Fquarry owned by Breedon. The company
OL,9,Fsays they are aware of an "incident"
OL,10,Fat their Taffs Well site.
OL,12,FThe cause of the flooding has yet to
OL,13,Fbe confirmed by authorities.
OL,15,FThe company said they are "working
OL,16,Fclosely with the relevant authorities
OL,17,Fwhile engaging with the local
OL,18,Fcommunity".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/10
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,451,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,FThe Health and Safety Executive said
OL,7,Fthey would be commencing an
OL,8,Finvestigation into the incident
OL,9,Falongside South Wales Police.
OL,11,FRoads in the area remain closed on
OL,12,FFriday morning.
OL,14,FOne local resident told ITV News how a
OL,15,F"force of water" came towards him and
OL,16,F"pushed him off his feet".
OL,18,FSteven Mordecai said: "I was hanging
OL,19,Fonto the gate, and I was literally
OL,20,Flaying on the water as it was forcing
OL,21,Fthe water through the gate.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/10
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,451,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,F"It was a shock, your brain can't
OL,7,Freact to it quickly'', he added.
OL,9,FAnother resident told ITV News how
OL,10,Fquickly the flood water entered her
OL,11,Fhome.
OL,13,FDebi Bode said: "The water was just
OL,14,Fbrown and rushing down the hill like a
OL,15,Friver. It must have hit our back
OL,16,Fgardens in less than a minute.
OL,18,F"All of a sudden it's gushing in, and
OL,19,Fit was coming in so fast. We couldn't
OL,20,Fstop it. We shut the door but it was
OL,21,Fcoming through the cat flap."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/10
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
