PN,43905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,FCardiff Council said highways and
OL,7,Fcleansing teams have been working on
OL,8,Fsite to clear roads and remove debris
OL,9,Fwhere it is safe to do so. However,
OL,10,Fsignificant damage has been caused to
OL,11,Fthe highway, with mud, silt, debris
OL,12,Fand other obstructions continuing to
OL,13,Fblock access.
OL,15,FThey said there are also ongoing
OL,16,Fsafety concerns relating to both the
OL,17,Froad and the surrounding embankments.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/10
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
