FL,451,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,FThe council added that due to the
OL,7,Fpossibility of river pollution, the
OL,8,Fpublic are advised not to enter the
OL,9,Fwatercourse of the rivers and not to
OL,10,Fallow their dogs to swim in the water
OL,11,Funtil the investigations are complete.
OL,13,FLeader of the Council, Cllr Chris
OL,14,FWeaver said: "Our priority remains the
OL,15,Fsafety and wellbeing of residents
OL,16,Faffected by this flooding incident. We
OL,17,Fare continuing to work closely with
OL,18,Fthe emergency services and partner
OL,19,Fagencies to support those affected,
OL,20,Fassess the damage and help the
OL,21,Fcommunity recover.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/10
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,451,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,F"I'd like to thank residents for their
OL,7,Fpatience and cooperation while road
OL,8,Fclosures remain in place. Significant
OL,9,Fdamage has been caused to the highway
OL,10,Finfrastructure, and it is vital that
OL,11,Fthese areas remain closed until they
OL,12,Fcan be made safe.
OL,14,F"Council teams will continue to
OL,15,Fsupport affected residents and carry
OL,16,Fout the necessary clean-up,
OL,17,Finvestigation and repair work as
OL,18,Fquickly and safely as possible."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/10
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
