PN,43908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,FA Health and Safety Executive
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "We were made aware
OL,8,Fof the incident yesterday evening and
OL,9,Fliaised with South Wales Police and
OL,10,Fthe emergency response team. We have
OL,11,Fattended the site and investigations
OL,12,Finto the incident have begun. We are
OL,13,Fworking with South Wales Police in
OL,14,Fcommencing an investigation."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G8/10
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
