PN,43909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1785851302
OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,FThe Cabinet Minister for Local
OL,7,FGovernment, Housing and Planning, Sian
OL,8,FGwenllian said: "This is a concerning
OL,9,Fincident and our thoughts are with the
OL,10,Fresidents and businesses affected by
OL,11,Fthe flooding in Gwaelod-y-garth,
OL,12,FCardiff.
OL,14,F"We continue to monitor the situation
OL,15,Fand support our partners as part of a
OL,16,Fmulti-agency response, which is now
OL,17,Ftransitioning to recovery.
OL,26,@oD@esp
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G9/10
