OL,3,CClean up underway as residents
OL,4,Cevacuated after 'incident' at quarry
OL,6,F"Relevant authorities will now be
OL,7,Finvestigating the incident to
OL,8,Funderstand exactly what happened so it
OL,9,Fwould not be appropriate for us to
OL,10,Fcomment further at this stage."
